Hanumān grows huge on Mahēndra to leap ocean --- Hanumān vows to find Sītā or seize Rāvaṇa --- Hanumān leaps with trees trailing and gods raining flowers --- Ocean raises Maināka for rest and Hanumān refuses haste --- Indra praises Maināka aid to Hanumān --- Surasā contests mouth size and Hanumān slips through blessed --- Hanumān slays shadow-grabber Siṃhikā tearing vitals --- Hanumān lands shrunken on Lamba and beholds Laṅkā
